{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GameInfo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a post-apocalyptic world following a virus outbreak, human civilization has collapsed. You will play as a lone survivor, struggling to stay alive in a small village surrounded by zombies. The village\u2019s resources are nearly exhausted, with most of the remaining supplies either spoiled or contaminated by zombies. Your mission is to survive under extreme conditions, not only by scavenging for supplies but also by avoiding infection and finding hope for escape amid the relentless threat of incoming zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a two-player cooperative survival game where you and your partner must rely on mutual trust and flawless teamwork to overcome hordes of zombies and find the only way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not just a survival game; it\u2019s also a dual test of coordination and intelligence. Together, you\u2019ll face unexpected challenges and devise the best strategies to turn danger into opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349930/extras/Guide1.png?t=1740214357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349930/extras/Guide2.png?t=1740214357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349930/extras/Guide3.png?t=1740214357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349930/extras/Guide4.png?t=1740214357\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349930/extras/Guide5.png?t=1740214357\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control</strong></h